# Defense-in-depth only — real applicant PII must never be staged in this repo in the first place.
# These patterns catch common accidental drops; they are not a substitute for review before commit.
*real_applicant*
*applicant_export*
*.pgp
*.gpg
EOD_JOURNAL_KEY*
*_PII_*
.env
.env.*

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

# Generated daily briefs are live-fetched content (real news/weather at run
# time) — don't commit actual runs into git history. The repo ships the
# script, not its output. See agents/scheduled/daily_area_news_brief/.
/briefings/

# Python test/runtime noise
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
